## DET-006 Investigation

Remote network authentication activity was identified with the following information:

```text
Source IP:
10.10.10.101

Account:
WIN11-01$
```

The activity was associated with the remote-access portion of the simulated attack sequence.

### Detection Engineering Observation

Successful Windows logon Event ID 4624 occurs frequently during legitimate activity.

Therefore, Event ID 4624 alone does not provide sufficient specificity to identify remote administrative SMB behavior.

This resulted in TUNE-001.

